OL,3,AFrom Nagaland to a path to the Oscars:
OL,4,AIndian film brings a rarely seen world
OL,5,Ato global cinema
OL,6,
OL,7,FThere is something pleasingly
OL,8,Fimprobable about Angh.
OL,10,FThe film comes from Nagaland, a
OL,11,Fmountainous state of fewer than two
OL,12,Fmillion people on India's northeastern
OL,13,Ffrontier, and is in Konyak, a tribal
OL,14,Flanguage unfamiliar to most Indians,
OL,15,Fnever mind audiences abroad. It was
OL,16,Fdirector Theja Rio's first feature and
OL,17,Fmost of its cast faced a camera for the
OL,18,Ffirst time.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
