OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AFrom Nagaland to a path to the Oscars:
OL,4,AIndian film brings a rarely seen world
OL,5,Ato global cinema
OL,6,
OL,7,FAnd yet, at the Toronto International
OL,8,FFilm Festival this month, this quiet
OL,9,Ffilm won the Platform Prize, a major
OL,10,Fjuried award.
OL,12,FThe award is intended to recognise
OL,13,Ffilms with a particularly distinctive
OL,14,Fdirectorial voice. The jury praised
OL,15,FRio's "refreshing perspective" and the
OL,16,Ffilm's portrait of a world rarely
OL,17,Fencountered on the international
OL,18,Fscreen.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
